iii) PASDEC will provide the complete list of idle machinery and the machinery in current use, so APMIA can assist PAASDEC for the accurate and proper utilization of these machinery.

iv) APMIA and PASDEC will jointly arrange at least one Exhibition especially for Marble/Granite/Stone sector. And will mutually participate in Xiamen Stone fair, China in March 2019

