vi) PASDEC will provide the list of board of directors with their complete details along with the bylaws of electing PASDEC board of directors so they can be elected through the mutual consent with APMIA in future.

vii) APMIA and PASDEC will mutually make future policies and plan of activities for the advancement and betterment of Stone Sector.

viii) PASDEC advisory committee will consist of the following APMIA members,

